    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MICRORNAS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"MicroRNAs are molecules studied by He in the context of cardiovascular disease and potential therapeutic targets."</data>
